# UX workflow: retained Pattern Editor, deterministic Randomize, exact history.
# Purpose: validates one musical path from root Pattern overview through a
# non-published Velocity preview, reroll, materialized Apply, Undo and Redo.
# Expect: semantic:velocity_preview:mode=sequencer.pattern_editor.randomize, semantic:velocity_preview:effect=preview_pattern_randomize, semantic:velocity_preview:source=velocity, semantic:velocity_preview:projection=preview
# Expect: semantic:randomize_rerolled:effect=reroll_pattern_randomize, semantic:randomize_rerolled:outcome=preview
# Expect: semantic:randomize_applied:effect=apply_pattern_randomize, semantic:randomize_applied:outcome=applied
# Expect: semantic:undo_applied:effect=undo_project_action, semantic:undo_applied:intent=undo
# Expect: semantic:redo_applied:effect=redo_project_action, semantic:redo_applied:intent=redo
# Expect: semantic:region_layer:effect=select_pattern_layer
# Expect: semantic:playing_pattern_early:effect=transport_start, semantic:playing_pattern_early:playing=true, semantic:playing_pattern_early:playhead=1
# Expect: semantic:playing_pattern_late:playing=true, semantic:playing_pattern_late:playhead=5

0 scenario sequencer

# Author four notes in Step context, then return to the root Pattern context.
100 button NAV down
160 encoder NAV 1
220 button NAV up
340 tap MACRO_1 60
440 tap MACRO_2 60
540 tap MACRO_3 60
640 tap MACRO_4 60
760 button NAV down
820 encoder NAV -1
880 button NAV up

# Open the retained Pattern Editor, extend to 16 steps and visit its second
# eight-step viewport without remounting the surface.
1040 tap NAV 60
1260 encoder OPT 0.21
1400 button LEFT_CENTER down
1480 encoder NAV 1
1620 capture screen second_window
1700 encoder NAV -1
1780 button LEFT_CENTER up

# The same modifier grammar selects the timeline layer. Notes wraps directly
# to Region in the current progressive layer list; return to Notes afterward.
1880 button LEFT_BOTTOM down
1960 encoder NAV -1
2100 capture screen region_layer
2180 encoder NAV 1
2260 button LEFT_BOTTOM up

# Randomize is an advanced action, not a permanent scalar field. Open its
# four-control draft directly from the action strip. Velocity changes remain a
# preview until Apply; reroll changes only the deterministic seed.
2340 tap BOTTOM_LEFT 60
2480 encoder OPT 0.50
2620 capture screen velocity_preview
2700 encoder NAV 1
2780 encoder OPT -0.50
2920 capture screen amount_preview
3020 tap BOTTOM_LEFT 60
3160 capture screen randomize_rerolled
3260 tap BOTTOM_RIGHT 60
3380 capture screen randomize_applied

# The retained editor returns to its previous Length focus after Apply.
3600 capture screen applied_pattern
3700 tap LEFT_TOP 60

# Global Undo, reopen Pattern Editor and observe the exact base Pattern.
3820 tap LEFT_TOP 60
4860 tick
4920 tap LEFT_CENTER 60
5000 capture screen undo_applied
5040 tap LEFT_TOP 60
5320 tap NAV 60
5580 tap LEFT_TOP 60

# Global Redo restores the already materialized target; no RNG runs again.
5700 tap LEFT_TOP 60
6740 tick
6800 tap LEFT_BOTTOM 60
6880 capture screen redo_applied
6920 tap LEFT_TOP 60
7200 tap NAV 60

# Transport remains globally available through the retained editor. Two
# captures prove the live playhead advances without changing context.
7420 tap BOTTOM_CENTER 60
7640 capture screen playing_pattern_early
8140 capture screen playing_pattern_late
8260 tap BOTTOM_CENTER 60
